    <h1>Why does this exist</h1>
    <p class="thesis">I'm Alan Lacroix. I was born in Mexico City, grew up in Miami, and I'm building a business in Mexico now. The more time I spent there, the less I felt I actually understood the place.</p>
    <p>So I built what I wanted to read: one page that follows the official numbers, picks the developments worth knowing, explains the background, and keeps what happened separate from what I think it means.</p>
    <p>It started as something for me. Family and friends began using it, so I made it public.</p>
